{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o042b","title":"孙权迁鄂改武昌置郡","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o042b-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"孙权迁鄂改武昌置郡","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o042b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"迁都置郡","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o042b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":221,"label":"四月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y221","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o042","basis":"四月"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o042b-q","wuzhu-q-o042","zhuge-q-o018","zhuge-q-b-30ab9f94bdfa25e92846"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o042b-q","source_order":[47,189,"O042b"],"order":8202}],"persons":[{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o042b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-56aade49054de10c4f85","layer":"original","quote":"权自公安都鄂〖5〗，改名武昌；以武昌、下雉、寻阳、阳新、柴桑、沙羡六县为武昌郡〖6〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":188,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":18,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o042","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-56aade49054de10c4f85","layer":"original","quote":"二年四月〖4〗，刘备称帝于蜀。﹝二﹞权自公安都鄂〖5〗，改名武昌；以武昌、下雉、寻阳、阳新、柴桑、沙羡六县为武昌郡〖6〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":188,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-b-30ab9f94bdfa25e92846","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-30ab9f94bdfa25e92846","layer":"modern","quote":"〖2〗二十六年：建安二十六年（公元 221 ）。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":106,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fe27b75c71b1c8c0ed04","start":0,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o018","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-9c6ac9490dfbf75fe10c","layer":"original","quote":"二十六年〖2〗，群下劝先主称尊号〖3〗，先主未许。亮说曰：“昔吴汉、耿弇等初劝世祖即帝位〖4〗，世祖辞让，前后数四，耿纯进言曰〖5〗：‘天下英雄喁喁〖6〗，冀有所望〖7〗。如不从议者，士大夫各归求主〖8〗，无为从公也〖9〗！’世祖感纯言深至〖10〗，遂然诺之〖11〗。今曹氏篡汉，天下无主；大王刘氏苗族〖12〗，绍世而起〖13〗：今即帝位，乃其宜也！士大夫随大王久勤苦者，亦欲望尺寸之功如纯言耳〖14〗。”","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":101,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":203,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
